    "summary": "Before the battle, during Muster Armies, each LEADER unit may pick one friendly BODYGUARD unit it can lead. The units form an Attached unit for the battle. Each BODYGUARD unit can have up to one LEADER and up to one SUPPORT unit attached, unless a rule changes that limit.",
